# NOTICE

dumbtv bundles no third-party software. It downloads what it runs, from the projects
that make it, under their own terms:

- personalDNSfilter (GPL-2.0) from F-Droid, the DNS filter that blocks what it
  cannot disable
- the HaGeZi blocklists (GPL-3.0), the tracker and update hosts it blocks
- SmartTube (MIT) from its own releases, if the owner asks for YouTube to be
  replaced
- AverageTV (<https://github.com/zaco-tm/AverageTV>, MIT), the home screen, which
  this repository installs and then checks

The launcher that was in this repository until it became the AverageTV project
vendored free-my-tv (MIT) and carried the My Kids TV catalogue (CC BY 4.0). Those
credits live with it now, in the AverageTV project's NOTICE.
